        "created_at": "2017-10-31T17:34:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Recently I was able to play a game of Spirit Island remotely and for the sake of time we decided that we would only fish Major Powers out of our respective power decks whenever someone else got one, and we were fine with the possibility of people having the same minor powers. How much does this affect the game?</p>",
